      "original_position": 6,
      "content": "skill-creator 的脚本未同步到工作区，但 SKILL.md 规范已注入，我按规范手动执行。先看看平台技能库/市场的情况，同时搜索 ClawdHub 和 GitHub 上有没有现成的「火车票代抢」技能。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_657689911479:msg_14",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 30730,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 14,
      "original_position": 7,
      "content": "市场线索：ClawdHub/GitHub 上有 `12306` 相关技能（查询余票），但需要确认有没有「代抢」类技能。我继续深入搜索 ClawdHub 注册表和 GitHub。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_657689911479:msg_17",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 30732,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 17,
      "original_position": 8,
      "content": "找到几个候选：ClawdHub 上有 `@kirorab/12306`（余票查询）、腾讯 SkillHub 上有 `12306-train-query`、Colaberry 有「12306 Train Assistant」（含候补/下单）。但严格叫「火车票代抢」的还没找到。我再精确搜一轮 ClawdHub 和 GitHub，同时看看平台市场入口。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_657689911479:msg_20",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 30734,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 20,
      "original_position": 9,
      "content": "市场扫描结论：ClawdHub/GitHub 上有 `@kirorab/12306`（12306 余票/时刻表查询）等技能，但没有现成的「火车票代抢」技能。平台市场这边没有直接访问入口（工作区仅有模拟市场测试技能）。\n\n我的方案：从 GitHub 拉取 `kirorab/12306-skill`（真实可用的 12306 查询脚本）作为基础，按 skill-creator 规范安装到 `workspace/skills/`，并补全「代抢」核心能力（余票监控轮询、抢票策略、候补/下单指引）和 EvoMind 市场信息。先检查 CLI 可用性。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_657689911479:msg_22",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 30737,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 22,
      "original_position": 10,
      "content": "openclaw CLI 不可用，但有 git/curl。直接从 GitHub 拉取 12306-skill 仓库看看内容："
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_657689911479:msg_26",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 30739,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 26,
      "original_position": 11,
      "content": "基础技能拿到了：`query.mjs`（余票查询）+ `stations.mjs`（车站查询），走 12306 官方公开 API、无需 key。先快速验证脚本能跑，然后开始安装改造。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_657689911479:msg_28",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 30741,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": "msg_N",
      "numeric_id": 28,
      "original_position": 12,
      "content": "脚本运行正常，能拉到实时余票。现在开始正式安装到 `workspace/skills/` 并构建「代抢」能力。先看一下 query.mjs 的 JSON 输出结构，用于写轮询监控脚本："
    },
